{"id":"9ef2b8e09ce08b94221e48a89813ed6f0aa67130","axis":"silent","repo":"hashicorp/consul","sha":"9ef2b8e09ce08b94221e48a89813ed6f0aa67130","parsed":{"files":[{"path":".changelog/23884.txt","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@","+```release-note:feature","+connect: add `ecdh_curves` to `mesh` config entries (`MeshDirectionalTLSConfig`) and `tls_ecdh_curves` to agent TLS configuration (`TLSProtocolConfig`) to support configuring allowed ECDH/KEM curves for sidecar mTLS and agent RPC/HTTPS/gRPC, with automatic hybrid Post-Quantum `X25519MLKEM768` curve injection when `tls_min_version` is set to `TLSv1_3`.","+```"],"additions":3,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"agent/config/builder.go","lines":["@@ -2372,6 +2372,37 @@ func (b *builder) tlsCipherSuites(name string, v *string, tlsMinVersion types.TL"," \treturn a"," }"," ","+// tlsECDHCurves parses ECDH curves from a comma-separated string into a","+// recognized slice","+func (b *builder) tlsECDHCurves(name string, v *string, tlsMinVersion types.TLSVersion) []types.TLSECDHCurve {","+\tif v == nil {","+\t\treturn nil","+\t}","+","+\tif err := types.ValidateTLSVersionECDHCurvesCompat(tlsMinVersion); err != nil {","+\t\tb.err = multierror.Append(b.err, fmt.Errorf(\"%s: %s\", name, err))","+\t\treturn nil","+\t}","+","+\t*v = strings.TrimSpace(*v)","+\tif *v == \"\" {","+\t\treturn []types.TLSECDHCurve{}","+\t}","+\tcurveStrings := strings.Split(*v, \",\")","+","+\ta := make([]types.TLSECDHCurve, len(curveStrings))","+\tfor i, curve := range curveStrings {","+\t\ta[i] = types.TLSECDHCurve(strings.TrimSpace(curve))","+\t}","+","+\terr := types.ValidateConsulAgentECDHCurves(a)","+\tif err != nil {","+\t\tb.err = multierror.Append(b.err, fmt.Errorf(\"%s: invalid TLS curves: %s\", name, err))","+\t\treturn []types.TLSECDHCurve{}","+\t}","+\treturn a","+}","+"," func (b *builder) nodeName(v *string) string {"," \tnodeName := stringVal(v)"," \tif nodeName == \"\" {","@@ -2866,6 +2897,7 @@ func (b *builder) buildTLSConfig(rt RuntimeConfig, t TLS) (tlsutil.Config, error"," "," \tdefaultTLSMinVersion := b.tlsVersion(\"tls.defaults.tls_min_version\", t.Defaults.TLSMinVersion)"," \tdefaultCipherSuites := b.tlsCipherSuites(\"tls.defaults.tls_cipher_suites\", t.Defaults.TLSCipherSuites, defaultTLSMinVersion)","+\tdefaultECDHCurves := b.tlsECDHCurves(\"tls.defaults.tls_ecdh_curves\", t.Defaults.TLSECDHCurves, defaultTLSMinVersion)"," "," \tmapCommon := func(name string, src TLSProtocolConfig, dst *tlsutil.ProtocolConfig) {"," \t\tdst.CAPath = stringValWithDefault(src.CAPath, stringVal(t.Defaults.CAPath))","@@ -2903,6 +2935,25 @@ func (b *builder) buildTLSConfig(rt RuntimeConfig, t TLS) (tlsutil.Config, error"," \t\t\t\tdst.TLSMinVersion,"," \t\t\t)"," \t\t}","+","+\t\tif src.TLSECDHCurves == nil {","+\t\t\tif len(defaultECDHCurves) > 0 {","+\t\t\t\tif types.ValidateTLSVersionECDHCurvesCompat(dst.TLSMinVersion) == nil {","+\t\t\t\t\tdst.ECDHCurves = defaultECDHCurves","+\t\t\t\t}","+\t\t\t} else {","+\t\t\t\t// Automatic curve injection: keep behaviour same as connect mesh","+\t\t\t\tif err, isLessThanTLS13 := dst.TLSMinVersion.LessThan(types.TLSv1_3); err == nil && !isLessThanTLS13 {","+\t\t\t\t\tdst.ECDHCurves = types.DefaultConsulAgentPQCECDHCurves","+\t\t\t\t}","+\t\t\t}","+\t\t} else {","+\t\t\tdst.ECDHCurves = b.tlsECDHCurves(","+\t\t\t\tfmt.Sprintf(\"tls.%s.tls_ecdh_curves\", name),","+\t\t\t\tsrc.TLSECDHCurves,","+\t\t\t\tdst.TLSMinVersion,","+\t\t\t)","+\t\t}"," \t}"," "," \tmapCommon(\"internal_rpc\", t.InternalRPC, &c.InternalRPC)"],"additions":51,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"agent/config/builder_test.go","lines":["@@ -794,6 +794,111 @@ func TestBuilder_tlsCipherSuites(t *testing.T) {"," \trequire.Contains(t, b.err.Error(), \"cipher suites are not configurable\")"," }"," ","+func TestBuilder_tlsECDHCurves(t *testing.T) {","+\tb := builder{}","+","+\tvalidCurves := strings.Join([]string{","+\t\t\"X25519MLKEM768\",","+\t\t\"X25519\",","+\t\t\"P-256\",","+\t\t\"P-384\",","+\t\t\"P-521\",","+\t}, \",\")","+\tgot := b.tlsECDHCurves(\"tls.defaults.tls_ecdh_curves\", &validCurves, types.TLSv1_2)","+\trequire.NoError(t, b.err)","+\trequire.Equal(t, []types.TLSECDHCurve{","+\t\ttypes.CurveX25519MLKEM768,","+\t\ttypes.CurveX25519,","+\t\ttypes.CurveP256,","+\t\ttypes.CurveP384,","+\t\ttypes.CurveP521,","+\t}, got)","+","+\t// Valid with TLS 1.3","+\tgot13 := b.tlsECDHCurves(\"tls.defaults.tls_ecdh_curves\", &validCurves, types.TLSv1_3)","+\trequire.NoError(t, b.err)","+\trequire.Len(t, got13, 5)","+","+\t// Invalid curve name","+\tinvalidCurves := \"curveX,X25519\"","+\tb.tlsECDHCurves(\"tls.defaults.tls_ecdh_curves\", &invalidCurves, types.TLSv1_2)","+","+\t// Incompatible with legacy TLS version","+\tb.tlsECDHCurves(\"tls.defaults.tls_ecdh_curves\", &validCurves, types.TLSv1_1)","+\tb.tlsECDHCurves(\"tls.defaults.tls_ecdh_curves\", &validCurves, types.TLSv1_0)","+","+\trequire.Error(t, b.err)","+\trequire.Contains(t, b.err.Error(), \"3 errors\")","+\trequire.Contains(t, b.err.Error(), \"no matching Consul Agent TLS curve found for curveX\")","+\trequire.Contains(t, b.err.Error(), \"ecdh_curves can only be configured when tls_min_version is 'TLSv1_2' or higher\")","+}","+","+func TestBuilder_buildTLSConfig_ECDHCurves(t *testing.T) {","+\tstrPtr := func(s string) *string { return &s }","+","+\tt.Run(\"defaults inherited and overridden\", func(t *testing.T) {","+\t\tb := builder{}","+\t\tcfg := TLS{","+\t\t\tDefaults: TLSProtocolConfig{","+\t\t\t\tTLSMinVersion: strPtr(\"TLSv1_2\"),","+\t\t\t\tTLSECDHCurves: strPtr(\"P-256,P-384\"),","+\t\t\t},","+\t\t\tInternalRPC: TLSProtocolConfig{","+\t\t\t\tTLSECDHCurves: strPtr(\"X25519MLKEM768,X25519\"),","+\t\t\t},","+\t\t\tHTTPS: TLSProtocolConfig{","+\t\t\t\t// inherits defaults","+\t\t\t},","+\t\t}","+","+\t\tres, err := b.buildTLSConfig(RuntimeConfig{}, cfg)","+\t\trequire.NoError(t, err)","+\t\trequire.Equal(t, []types.TLSECDHCurve{types.CurveX25519MLKEM768, types.CurveX25519}, res.InternalRPC.ECDHCurves)","+\t\trequire.Equal(t, []types.TLSECDHCurve{types.CurveP256, types.CurveP384}, res.HTTPS.ECDHCurves)","+\t\trequire.Equal(t, []types.TLSECDHCurve{types.CurveP256, types.CurveP384}, res.GRPC.ECDHCurves)","+\t})","+","+\tt.Run(\"auto injection when TLSv1_3 and curves unspecified\", func(t *testing.T) {","+\t\tb := builder{}","+\t\tcfg := TLS{","+\t\t\tDefaults: TLSProtocolConfig{","+\t\t\t\tTLSMinVersion: strPtr(\"TLSv1_3\"),","+\t\t\t},","+\t\t\tInternalRPC: TLSProtocolConfig{","+\t\t\t\t// inherits TLSv1_3 and gets auto-injected curves","+\t\t\t},","+\t\t\tHTTPS: TLSProtocolConfig{","+\t\t\t\t// explicit override curve","+\t\t\t\tTLSECDHCurves: strPtr(\"P-256\"),","+\t\t\t},","+\t\t}","+","+\t\tres, err := b.buildTLSConfig(RuntimeConfig{}, cfg)","+\t\trequire.NoError(t, err)","+\t\trequire.Equal(t, types.DefaultConsulAgentPQCECDHCurves, res.InternalRPC.ECDHCurves)","+\t\trequire.Equal(t, types.DefaultConsulAgentPQCECDHCurves, res.GRPC.ECDHCurves)","+\t\trequire.Equal(t, []types.TLSECDHCurve{types.CurveP256}, res.HTTPS.ECDHCurves)","+\t})","+","+\tt.Run(\"safe omit curves on legacy override\", func(t *testing.T) {","+\t\tb := builder{}","+\t\tcfg := TLS{","+\t\t\tDefaults: TLSProtocolConfig{","+\t\t\t\tTLSMinVersion: strPtr(\"TLSv1_2\"),","+\t\t\t\tTLSECDHCurves: strPtr(\"X25519\"),","+\t\t\t},","+\t\t\tHTTPS: TLSProtocolConfig{","+\t\t\t\tTLSMinVersion: strPtr(\"TLSv1_0\"),","+\t\t\t},","+\t\t}","+","+\t\tres, err := b.buildTLSConfig(RuntimeConfig{}, cfg)","+\t\trequire.NoError(t, err)","+\t\trequire.Equal(t, []types.TLSECDHCurve{types.CurveX25519}, res.InternalRPC.ECDHCurves)","+\t\trequire.Empty(t, res.HTTPS.ECDHCurves)","+\t})","+}","+"," func TestBuilder_parsePrefixFilter(t *testing.T) {"," \tt.Run(\"Check that 1.12 rpc metrics are parsed correctly.\", func(t *testing.T) {"," \t\ttype testCase struct {"],"additions":105,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"agent/config/config.deepcopy.go","lines":["@@ -382,14 +382,26 @@ func (o *RuntimeConfig) DeepCopy(